[00:16.28]Something precious to Jehovah,
[00:20.06]Bringing him such keen delight,
[00:25.16]Is his Kingdom by Christ Jesus,
[00:29.76]Which will set all matters right.
[00:34.37](Chorus)
[00:34.52]Keep on seeking first the Kingdom
[00:38.38]And Jehovah’s righteousness.
[00:43.70]Sing his praise among the nations,
[00:48.32]Serving him in faithfulness.
[01:04.54]Why be anxious for tomorrow,
[01:08.36]‘Will we hunger, will we thirst?’
[01:13.50]For our God will make provision
[01:17.34]If we seek his Kingdom first.
[01:22.69](Chorus)
[01:22.84]Keep on seeking first the Kingdom
[01:26.94]And Jehovah’s righteousness.
[01:32.32]Sing his praise among the nations,
[01:37.04]Serving him in faithfulness.
[01:41.98]So declare the Kingdom good news;
[02:00.08]Help deserving ones to see
[02:04.62]That their hope is in Jehovah
[02:08.46]And in his Theocracy.
[02:12.47](Chorus)
[02:12.62]Keep on seeking first the Kingdom
[02:20.74]And Jehovah’s righteousness.
[02:27.22]Sing his praise among the nations,
[02:32.70]Serving him in faithfulness.
